[{"id":3505336249,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7Q7y-5","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?u=9b90963f1b4f17720e50bbbe495fbe8c84c8bc8e&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","login":"TokageItLab","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab"},"body":"Considering the function's meaning, I think it is incorrect for `_blend_pre_process()` to return `cache_valid`.\r\n\r\nTherefore, if you want to do that, simply adding the following check should suffice:\r\n\r\n**animation_mixer.cpp**\r\n```cpp\r\nvoid AnimationMixer::_process_animation(double p_delta, bool p_update_only) {\r\n\t_blend_init();\r\n\tif (cache_valid && _blend_pre_process(p_delta, track_count, track_map)) {\r\n\t\t_blend_capture(p_delta);\r\n\t\t_blend_calc_total_weight();\r\n\t\t_blend_process(p_delta, p_update_only);\r\n\t\t_blend_apply();\r\n\t\t_blend_post_process();\r\n\t\temit_signal(SNAME(\"mixer_applied\"));\r\n\t};\r\n\tclear_animation_instances();\r\n}\r\n```","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113140#pullrequestreview-3505336249","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113140","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-11-25T14:26:59Z"},{"id":3505471913,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7Q8UGp","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"d968c3e5d699a27a7c61789e5c015633b689da41","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24624901?u=52e97bedd914aa7cab5b584a6244f72130a0d8bc&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/LanzaSchneider","id":24624901,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI